# Autonomous Discovery and Delta Detection Architecture

This implementation plan outlines the architecture for transforming the system from a passive "refresh" tool into an autonomous AI tool discovery and lifecycle tracking engine.

## User Review and Decisions
- **Platforms/Tools**: The scanner will monitor GitHub, HuggingFace, Replit, and top industry aggregators (via Tavily/DuckDuckGo web search).
- **Scheduling**: The Discovery Pipeline will run daily at 8:00 PM IST using a background scheduler (e.g., `APScheduler`) AND will also be triggered manually when the user clicks the "Refresh" option in the UI.
- **LLM Strategy**: The system will implement a **Fallback Switch**. It will attempt to use the local `llama3.2:1b` model first. If the local model fails, returns null, or achieves a validation score below 90%, the system will automatically switch to a cloud provider (e.g., OpenAI or Anthropic) to complete the extraction.

